Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:41:09 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1029/1198] Post as numbered steps: one tool at a time, the
 ones done for the take ticked

Spectrum, Artifacts, Lyrics, Stems, Remaster, Upscale in a row, in the order the work goes
(Viktor: the stack of drawers was hard to use). The chosen step shows alone and is
remembered; the take card buttons open Post at their step. A step is ticked once done for
the take in hand: the tools report it (heresy-step), and the tree of derived files tells
which of stems, remaster and upscale exist. Import stays above the steps: it makes the take.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
